# Copy to mobile/.env and fill in from Supabase: Project Settings → API.
# Leave both empty to run the app in demo mode (mock data, demo sign-in code).
# The anon (publishable) key is designed to ship in apps; row-level security
# in supabase/migrations protects the data. Never put the service_role key here.
EXPO_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=
EXPO_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
